{
    "id":  26495,
    "lang":  "en",
    "name":  "Solar LED Street Light Kit EcoUrban 120 1800Lm | PIR Sensor + Remote Control + 2.5m Aluminum Pole | 3CCT",
    "reference":  "KIT-91564",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003eEcoUrban Circular Solar LED Street Light 120W Ø45cm + 2.5 Meter Aluminum Pole Kit\u003c/strong\u003e combines modern 360º design, energy efficiency, and easy installation. Solar street light incorporates LEDs \u003cstrong\u003eSMD2835 selectable 3CCT (3000K/4000K/6500K)\u003c/strong\u003e with up to \u003cstrong\u003e1800 lumens\u003c/strong\u003e, PIR motion sensor, remote control, and \u003cstrong\u003e12,000 mAh\u003c/strong\u003e battery with up to \u003cstrong\u003e14 hours\u003c/strong\u003e autonomy. Kit includes \u003cstrong\u003e2.5m modular aluminum pole\u003c/strong\u003e. \u003cstrong\u003eIP65\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2\u003eKit EcoUrban 120 LED Solar Street Light 1800Lm | PIR Sensor + Remote Control + 2.5m Aluminium Pole | 3CCT\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003eKit EcoUrban 120W Circular LED Solar Street Light with 2.5-Metre Modular Aluminium Pole\u003c/strong\u003e is a complete outdoor lighting solution designed to offer maximum energy efficiency, modern design and fully autonomous operation. This set combines an elegant 360º circular LED solar street light with a sturdy modular aluminium pole, making it the ideal choice for urban, residential and decorative lighting projects without the need for electrical connection.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003eEcoUrban 120W Ø45 cm LED Solar Street Light\u003c/strong\u003e incorporates \u003cstrong\u003ehigh-efficiency SMD2835 LED\u003c/strong\u003e technology and a \u003cstrong\u003eselectable 3CCT system\u003c/strong\u003e, allowing you to choose between three colour temperatures: \u003cstrong\u003e3000K warm light\u003c/strong\u003e, \u003cstrong\u003e4000K neutral light\u003c/strong\u003e and \u003cstrong\u003e6500K cool light\u003c/strong\u003e. With up to \u003cstrong\u003e1800 lumens\u003c/strong\u003e, it provides uniform and comfortable lighting for streets, gardens, patios, pathways, plots and all types of outdoor spaces.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eIts innovative circular design with \u003cstrong\u003e360º\u003c/strong\u003e illumination allows homogeneous light distribution, improving both the aesthetics and functionality of the space. This makes it an excellent option for urban areas, residential communities, parks, home entrances and pedestrian areas where modern, efficient and decorative lighting is sought.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe street light incorporates a practical \u003cstrong\u003ePIR motion sensor\u003c/strong\u003e, which optimises energy savings by automatically activating the lighting when presence is detected. It also includes a convenient \u003cstrong\u003eremote control\u003c/strong\u003e to easily manage different operating modes, light intensity and energy-saving options according to the needs of each installation.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe solar system consists of an efficient \u003cstrong\u003e15W 5V monocrystalline solar panel\u003c/strong\u003e and a rechargeable lithium battery of \u003cstrong\u003e12,000 mAh\u003c/strong\u003e, providing between \u003cstrong\u003e12 and 14 hours of autonomy\u003c/strong\u003e after a full charge. Thanks to its operation on solar energy, it completely eliminates electricity consumption and avoids complex wiring installations.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eManufactured with resistant materials and equipped with \u003cstrong\u003eIP65 waterproof and dustproof protection\u003c/strong\u003e, this LED solar street light is ready to withstand rain, humidity, dust and adverse weather conditions throughout the year, guaranteeing maximum durability and minimal maintenance.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe kit includes a sturdy \u003cstrong\u003e2.5-metre modular aluminium pole\u003c/strong\u003e, specially designed for the installation of solar street lights and luminaires. It consists of \u003cstrong\u003e6 modular pieces of 450 mm\u003c/strong\u003e, offering a fast, practical and portable mounting system. Its design incorporates a functional \u003cstrong\u003eintegrated water tank\u003c/strong\u003e, providing greater stability and safety once installed. Furthermore, the \u003cstrong\u003eØ58 mm diameter\u003c/strong\u003e tube guarantees perfect compatibility with the EcoUrban range and other similar solar luminaires.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eApplications and recommended uses\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003eEcoUrban 120W Kit\u003c/strong\u003e is perfect for multiple outdoor applications:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\nGardens and patios\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\nPaths and walkways\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\nPlots and estates\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\nStreets and urban areas\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\nHome and garage entrances\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\nResidential communities\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\nOutdoor car parks\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\nParks and pedestrian areas\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\nDecorative and ambient lighting\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\nAreas without access to the electrical grid\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003eThanks to its modern design, efficient lighting and autonomous operation via solar energy, this outdoor lighting kit is an ecological, economical and easy-to-install solution for both residential and professional use.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eImportant:\u003c/strong\u003e the solar street light and the modular pole \u003cstrong\u003eare delivered separately\u003c/strong\u003e to facilitate transport and installation.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eIf you are looking for a \u003cstrong\u003emodern, resistant and low-consumption circular LED solar street light\u003c/strong\u003e, the \u003cstrong\u003eEcoUrban 120W Kit with aluminium pole\u003c/strong\u003e is the ideal option to illuminate any outdoor space with style, safety and maximum energy efficiency.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\n\n\u003c/p\u003e",
